# Never ship data in the agent image (Dockerfile header). Allow-list style:
# ignore everything, then re-include only what the Dockerfile COPYs.
*
!requirements.txt
!requirements-aws.txt
!agents/
!detection_engine/
!datainsights/
!external_events/*.py
!config/
!prompts/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/protected_evaluator_only/**
**/output*/**
